  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Re-entry rules",
      "items": [
        "run() moves IDLE, PAUSED, ERROR and STUCK to RUNNING (local_conversation.py:1923-1930)",
        "send_message() resets FINISHED and STUCK to IDLE so a new turn can run (1831-1838)",
        "A second run() while WAITING executes the pending actions; reject_pending_actions() emits UserRejectObservation and sets IDLE"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "What 'terminal' means here",
      "items": [
        "is_terminal() is FINISHED, ERROR, STUCK: terminal for one run, not for the conversation (state.py:62-79)",
        "MaxIterationsReached and MaxBudgetReached are ConversationErrorEvents, not crashes",
        "interrupt() cancels arun(); orphaned actions get synthetic AgentErrorEvents"
      ]
    }
  ]
